# Terrain rows, matched IN ORDER: a tile takes the first row whose bands
# all contain its field values (elevation / moisture / drainage /
# temperature, each 0..1; a missing band means "don't care", so the last
# row catches all). The row's position is its id; name is also the art
# prefix (<name>_ground.png etc). rank orders boundary spill: higher
# covers lower -- softer forms over harder ones. move_cost <= 0 is
# impassable. overlay_density is the percent of interior tiles carrying
# overlay art -- rows with overlay art must declare it.

